{"strongs": "H4503", "word": "מִנְחָה", "translit": "min.chah", "root": "מנח", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "gift, tribute, offering", "definition": "מִנְחָה 153 noun feminine gift, tribute, offering (Late Hebrew id. ; Phoenician מנחת ; ᵑ7 מִנְחָתָא ; on Arabic see above); — absolute ׳ מ Gen 4:3 + 81 t.; construct מִנְחַת Lev 2:7 + 22 t.; suffix מִנְחָתִי Gen 33:10 + 3 t.; + 41 t. suffixes singular; plural suffix מִנְחֹתֶיךָ Ps 20:4 מִנְחֹתֵיבֶם Num 29:39 ; Amos 5:22 — 1. gift, present Gen 32:14; 32:19; 32:21; Gen 32:22 ( E ), Gen 33:10 ; Gen 43:11 ; Gen 43:15 ; Gen 43:25 ; Gen 43:26 ( J ), Judg 6:18 ; 1Sam 10:27 ; 1Kgs 10:25 = 2Chr 9:24 ; 2Kgs 8:8 ; 2Kgs 8:9 ; 2Kgs 20:12 = Isa 39:1 ; Ps 45:13 ; 2Chr 32:23 . 2. tribute Judg 3:15 ; Judg 3:17 ; Judg 3:18 (twice in verse); 2Sam 8:2 ; 2Sam 8:6 = 1Chr 18:2 18:6, 1Kgs 5:1 ; 2Kgs 17:3 ; 2Kgs 17:4 ; 2Chr 17:5 ; 2Chr 17:11 ; 2Chr 26:8 ; Hos 10:6 ; Ps 72:10 . 3. offering made to God, of any kind, whether grain or animals Gen 4:3 ; Gen 4:4 ; Gen 4:5 ; Num 16:15 ( J ), 1Sam 2:17 ; 1Sam 2:29 ; 1Sam 26:19 ; Isa 1:13 ; Ps 96:8 ; Zeph 3:10 + (probably) (לַ)עֲלוֺת הַ֫מִּנְחָה 1Kgs 18:29 ; 1Kgs 18:36 ; 2Kgs 3:20 (Ehpraimitic source; usually regarded as = מִנְחַת עֶרֶב , but that much later usage). This general meaning possibly an also in following; זבח ומנחה 1Sam 2:29 (see v 1Sam 2:29 b), 1Sam 3:14 ; Isa 19:21 עלה ומנחה Jer 14:12 || עולה Ps 20:4 || שֶׁלֶם Amos 5:22 ( עֹלוֺת gloss, to explain אָרִיחַ ); or these may shew early stage of discrimination. 4. grain offering (whether raw, roasted, ground to flour, or prepared as bread or cakes, see below. AV meat offering , misleading < RV meal-offering. GFM Judg 3:22 renders cereal oblation ); — יָבִיאוּ אֶתהַֿמִּנְחָה בִּכְלִי טָהוֺר Isa 66:20 they bring the grain offering in clean vessels (restored Jews are brought as such an offering), compare מנחה טהורה Mal 1:11 brought in hands Jer 41:5 (late addition Co ); received from hands Mal 1:10 חִטִּים למנחה 1Chr 21:23 wheat for grain offering ; סֹלֶת 1Chr 23:29 , mixed with oil Ezek 46:14 , baked v Ezek 46:20 distinguished from other offerings 1Kgs 8:64 (twice in verse) = 2Chr 7:7 ; 2Kgs 16:13 ; 2Kgs 16:15 (3 t. in verse); Isa 43:23 ; Isa 57:6 ; Isa 66:3 ; Jer 17:26 ; Jer 33:18 ; Jer 41:5 (late editors Co ), Ezek 42:13 ; Ezek 44:29 ; Ezek 45:15 ; Ezek 45:17 (twice in verse); Ezek 45:25 ; Dan 9:27 ; Ps 40:7 used alone Neh 13:5 ; Neh 13:9 ; Ezek 45:24 ; Ezek 46:5 (twice in verse); Ezek 46:7 ; Ezek 46:11 ; Ezek 46:14 (twice in verse); Ezek 46:15 ; Mal 1:13 ; Mal 2:12 ; Mal 2:13 ; Mal 3:3 ; Mal 3:4 ; Judg 13:19 ; Judg 13:23 ( R , GFM Jud 322 ); (הָ) עֶרֶב מִנְחַת evening grain offering 2Kgs 16:15 ; Ezra 9:4 ; Ezra 9:5 ; Dan 9:21 ; Ps 141:2 מִנְחַת הַתָּמִיד continual grain off . Neh 10:34 , compare Lev 6:13 ; Num 4:16 (all cases under 4 exilic or post-exilic ). 5. grain-offering , always with this meaning in P , in classifications Exod 30:9 ; Exod 40:29 ; Lev 7:37 ; Lev 23:37 ; Num 18:9 ; Num 29:39 — \\ \\ a. אָבִיב grain in the ear parched with fire, with oil and frankincense Lev 2:14 ; Lev 2:15 . \\ \\ b. סֹלֶת fine flour with oil and frankincense Lev 2:1 ; Lev 6:7 elsewhere בְּלוּלָה בַּשֶּׁמֶן mingled with oil Lev 14:10 ; Lev 14:21 ; Lev 23:13 ; Num 7:13 + 10 t. Num 8:8 ; Num 15:4 ; Num 15:6 ; Num 15:9 ; Num 28:5 + 6 t. Num 29:3 ; Num 29:9 ; Num 29:14 , except sin offering of very poor where offered without oil and frankincense Lev 5:11-13 . \\ \\ c. סֹלֶת baked in an oven as חַלּוֺת perforated cakes, or רְקִיקִים flat cakes Lev 2:4 ; Lev 7:9 ; Num 6:15 , על הַמַּחֲבַת on a flat pan Lev 2:5 ; Lev 6:14 ; Lev 7:9 , or מַרְחֶשֶׁת frying pan Lev 2:7 ; Lev 7:9 . All these always unleavened ( מַצּוֺת ) and mixed with oil and salt Lev 2:11-13 . \\ \\ d. at Pentecost to consecrate new bread, מִנְחָה חֲדָשָׁה new grain offering of two loaves of leavened bread Lev 23:16 ; Lev 23:17 ; Num 28:26 \\ \\ e. barley meal without oil or incense; מִנְחַת קְנָאֹת grain offering of jealousy , זִכָּרוֺן ׳ מ Num 5:15 ; Num 5:18 ; Num 5:25 . compare phrases מִנְחַת הַבֹּקֶר morning oblation Exod 29:41 ; Num 28:8 ׳ קָרְבַּן מ Lev 2:1 ; Lev 2:4 ; Lev 2:13 בִּכּוּרִים ׳ מ Lev 2:14 פִּתִּים ׳ מ Lev 6:14 . 6. verbs of offering are הֵבִיא Gen 4:3 ( J ), Lev 2:2 ; Lev 2:8 ( P ), Isa 1:13 ; Isa 66:20 (twice in verse); Jer 17:26 ; Mal 1:13 הִקְרִיב Lev 2:1 ; Lev 2:8 ; Lev 2:11 ; Lev 6:7 ; Num 5:25 עשׂה Num 6:17 ; Num 28:31 ; 1Kgs 8:64 = 2Chr 7:7 ; Ezek 45:24 ; Ezek 46:7 ; Ezek 46:14 ; Ezek 46:15 הקטיר 2Kgs 16:13 ; 2Kgs 16:15 ; Jer 33:18 העלה Isa 57:6 ; Isa 66:3 ; Jer 14:12 הגישׁ Amos 5:25 ; Mal 2:12 ; Mal 3:3 הוביל Zeph 3:10 נשׂא Ps 96:8 , also ( ׳ מ = tribute ) 2Sam 8:2 ; 2Sam 8:6 and ||. מְנֻחָה see מְנוּחָה below נוח . מְנַחֵם see נחם . מָנַ֫חַת , מְנֻחוֺת , מָנַחְתִּי see נוח . מְנִי see מנה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4722')\">BDB4722</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4503')\">H4503</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4721')\">BDB4721</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4723')\">BDB4723</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִנְחָה</bdbheb><sub>153</sub> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>gift, tribute, offering</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Phoenician <bdbheb>מנחת</bdbheb>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>מִנְחָתָא</bdbheb>; on Arabic see above); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 4:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,3)\">Gen 4:3</ref> + 81 t.; construct <bdbheb>מִנְחַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,7)\">Lev 2:7</ref> + 22 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מִנְחָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 33:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,10)\">Gen 33:10</ref> + 3 t.; + 41 t. suffixes singular; plural suffix <bdbheb>מִנְחֹתֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 20:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,20,4)\">Ps 20:4</ref> <bdbheb>מִנְחֹתֵיבֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 29:39\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,39)\">Num 29:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 5:22\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,22)\">Amos 5:22</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>gift, present</highlight> Gen 32:14; 32:19; 32:21; <ref ref=\"Gen 32:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,22)\">Gen 32:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Gen 33:10\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,10)\">Gen 33:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 43:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,11)\">Gen 43:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 43:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,15)\">Gen 43:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 43:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,25)\">Gen 43:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 43:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,26)\">Gen 43:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 6:18\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,18)\">Judg 6:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:27\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,27)\">1Sam 10:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:25\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,25)\">1Kgs 10:25</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:24\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,24)\">2Chr 9:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,8)\">2Kgs 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,9)\">2Kgs 8:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 20:12\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(12,20,12)\">2Kgs 20:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 39:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,39,1)\">Isa 39:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 45:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,45,13)\">Ps 45:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:23\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,23)\">2Chr 32:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>tribute</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 3:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,15)\">Judg 3:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 3:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,17)\">Judg 3:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 3:18\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,18)\">Judg 3:18</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,2)\">2Sam 8:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 8:6\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(10,8,6)\">2Sam 8:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 18:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,18,2)\">1Chr 18:2</ref> 18:6, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,1)\">1Kgs 5:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,3)\">2Kgs 17:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,4)\">2Kgs 17:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,5)\">2Chr 17:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,11)\">2Chr 17:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,8)\">2Chr 26:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 10:6\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,6)\">Hos 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 72:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"72\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"72\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,72,10)\">Ps 72:10</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>offering</highlight> made to God, of any kind, whether grain or animals <ref ref=\"Gen 4:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,3)\">Gen 4:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 4:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,4)\">Gen 4:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 4:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,5)\">Gen 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 16:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,16,15)\">Num 16:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,17)\">1Sam 2:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:29\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,29)\">1Sam 2:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 26:19\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(9,26,19)\">1Sam 26:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 1:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,13)\">Isa 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 96:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"96\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"96\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,96,8)\">Ps 96:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zeph 3:10\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(36,3,10)\">Zeph 3:10</ref> + (probably) <bdbheb>(לַ)עֲלוֺת הַ֫מִּנְחָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:29\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,29)\">1Kgs 18:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:36\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,36)\">1Kgs 18:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:20\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,20)\">2Kgs 3:20</ref> (Ehpraimitic source; usually regarded as = <bdbheb>מִנְחַת עֶרֶב</bdbheb>, but that much later usage). This general meaning possibly an also in following; <bdbheb>זבח ומנחה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:29\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,29)\">1Sam 2:29</ref> (see v<ref ref=\"1Sam 2:29\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,29)\">1Sam 2:29</ref> b), <ref ref=\"1Sam 3:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,3,14)\">1Sam 3:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 19:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,21)\">Isa 19:21</ref> <bdbheb>עלה ומנחה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 14:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,12)\">Jer 14:12</ref> || <bdbheb>עולה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 20:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,20,4)\">Ps 20:4</ref> || <bdbheb>שֶׁלֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 5:22\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,22)\">Amos 5:22</ref> (<bdbheb>עֹלוֺת</bdbheb> gloss, to explain <bdbheb>אָרִיחַ</bdbheb>); or these may shew early stage of discrimination. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>grain offering</highlight> (whether raw, roasted, ground to flour, or prepared as bread or cakes, see below. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <highlight>meat offering</highlight>, misleading &lt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup> <highlight>meal-offering.</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup><ref ref=\"Judg 3:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,22)\">Judg 3:22</ref> renders</sup></lookup> <highlight>cereal oblation</highlight>); — <bdbheb>יָבִיאוּ אֶתהַֿמִּנְחָה בִּכְלִי טָהוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 66:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,20)\">Isa 66:20</ref> <highlight>they bring the grain offering in clean vessels</highlight> (restored Jews are brought as such an offering), compare <bdbheb>מנחה טהורה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mal 1:11\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(39,1,11)\">Mal 1:11</ref> brought in hands <ref ref=\"Jer 41:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,41,5)\">Jer 41:5</ref> (late addition <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>); received from hands <ref ref=\"Mal 1:10\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(39,1,10)\">Mal 1:10</ref> <bdbheb>חִטִּים למנחה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 21:23\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(13,21,23)\">1Chr 21:23</ref> <highlight>wheat for grain offering</highlight>; <bdbheb>סֹלֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:29\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,29)\">1Chr 23:29</ref>, mixed with oil <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,14)\">Ezek 46:14</ref>, baked v<ref ref=\"Ezek 46:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,20)\">Ezek 46:20</ref> distinguished from other offerings <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:64\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"64\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"64\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,64)\">1Kgs 8:64</ref> (twice in verse) = <ref ref=\"2Chr 7:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,7)\">2Chr 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,13)\">2Kgs 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,15)\">2Kgs 16:15</ref> (3 t. in verse); <ref ref=\"Isa 43:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,43,23)\">Isa 43:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 57:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,6)\">Isa 57:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 66:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,3)\">Isa 66:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 17:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,26)\">Jer 17:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 33:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,18)\">Jer 33:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 41:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,41,5)\">Jer 41:5</ref> (late editors <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,13)\">Ezek 42:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:29\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,29)\">Ezek 44:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,15)\">Ezek 45:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,17)\">Ezek 45:17</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:25\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,25)\">Ezek 45:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:27\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,27)\">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 40:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,7)\">Ps 40:7</ref> used alone <ref ref=\"Neh 13:5\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,5)\">Neh 13:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 13:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,9)\">Neh 13:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,24)\">Ezek 45:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,5)\">Ezek 46:5</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,7)\">Ezek 46:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,11)\">Ezek 46:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,14)\">Ezek 46:14</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,15)\">Ezek 46:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 1:13\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(39,1,13)\">Mal 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 2:12\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(39,2,12)\">Mal 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 2:13\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(39,2,13)\">Mal 2:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 3:3\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,3)\">Mal 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 3:4\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,4)\">Mal 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,19)\">Judg 13:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:23\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,23)\">Judg 13:23</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink></lookup>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup>Jud 322</sup></lookup>); <bdbheb>(הָ) עֶרֶב מִנְחַת</bdbheb> <highlight>evening grain offering</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:15\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,15)\">2Kgs 16:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:4\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,4)\">Ezra 9:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,5)\">Ezra 9:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 9:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,9,21)\">Dan 9:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 141:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"141\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"141\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,141,2)\">Ps 141:2</ref> <bdbheb>מִנְחַת הַתָּמִיד</bdbheb> <highlight>continual grain off</highlight>. <ref ref=\"Neh 10:34\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,34)\">Neh 10:34</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Lev 6:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,13)\">Lev 6:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,16)\">Num 4:16</ref> (all cases under <b>4</b> <highlightword>exilic or post-exilic</highlightword>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>grain-offering</highlight>, always with this meaning in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, in classifications <ref ref=\"Exod 30:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,9)\">Exod 30:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,29)\">Exod 40:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 7:37\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,37)\">Lev 7:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:37\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,37)\">Lev 23:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 18:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,18,9)\">Num 18:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:39\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,39)\">Num 29:39</ref> — <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>אָבִיב</bdbheb> grain in the ear parched with fire, with oil and frankincense <ref ref=\"Lev 2:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,14)\">Lev 2:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 2:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,15)\">Lev 2:15</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <bdbheb>סֹלֶת</bdbheb> fine flour with oil and frankincense <ref ref=\"Lev 2:1\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,1)\">Lev 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,7)\">Lev 6:7</ref> elsewhere <bdbheb>בְּלוּלָה בַּשֶּׁמֶן</bdbheb> mingled with oil <ref ref=\"Lev 14:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,10)\">Lev 14:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,21)\">Lev 14:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,13)\">Lev 23:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 7:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,7,13)\">Num 7:13</ref> + 10 t. <ref ref=\"Num 8:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,8)\">Num 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 15:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,4)\">Num 15:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 15:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,6)\">Num 15:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 15:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,9)\">Num 15:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,5)\">Num 28:5</ref> + 6 t. <ref ref=\"Num 29:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,3)\">Num 29:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,9)\">Num 29:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,14)\">Num 29:14</ref>, except sin offering of very poor where offered without oil and frankincense <ref ref=\"Lev 5:11-13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,11)\">Lev 5:11-13</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>סֹלֶת</bdbheb> baked in an oven as <bdbheb>חַלּוֺת</bdbheb> perforated cakes, or <bdbheb>רְקִיקִים</bdbheb> flat cakes <ref ref=\"Lev 2:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,4)\">Lev 2:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 7:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,9)\">Lev 7:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 6:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,15)\">Num 6:15</ref>, <bdbheb>על הַמַּחֲבַת</bdbheb> <highlight>on a flat pan</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,5)\">Lev 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,14)\">Lev 6:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 7:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,9)\">Lev 7:9</ref>, or <bdbheb>מַרְחֶשֶׁת</bdbheb> <highlight>frying pan</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,7)\">Lev 2:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 7:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,9)\">Lev 7:9</ref>. All these always unleavened (<bdbheb>מַצּוֺת</bdbheb>) and mixed with oil and salt <ref ref=\"Lev 2:11-13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,11)\">Lev 2:11-13</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> at Pentecost to consecrate new bread, <bdbheb>מִנְחָה חֲדָשָׁה</bdbheb> <highlight>new grain offering</highlight> of two loaves of leavened bread <ref ref=\"Lev 23:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,16)\">Lev 23:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,17)\">Lev 23:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,26)\">Num 28:26</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> barley meal without oil or incense; <bdbheb>מִנְחַת קְנָאֹת</bdbheb> <highlight>grain offering of jealousy</highlight>, <bdbheb>זִכָּרוֺן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 5:15\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,15)\">Num 5:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,18)\">Num 5:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,25)\">Num 5:25</ref>. compare phrases <bdbheb>מִנְחַת הַבֹּקֶר</bdbheb> <highlight>morning oblation</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:41\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,41)\">Exod 29:41</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,8)\">Num 28:8</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קָרְבַּן מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:1\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,1)\">Lev 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 2:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,4)\">Lev 2:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 2:13\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,13)\">Lev 2:13</ref> <bdbheb>בִּכּוּרִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,14)\">Lev 2:14</ref> <bdbheb>פִּתִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,14)\">Lev 6:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> verbs of <highlight>offering</highlight> are <bdbheb>הֵבִיא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 4:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,3)\">Gen 4:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Lev 2:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,2)\">Lev 2:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 2:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,8)\">Lev 2:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Isa 1:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,13)\">Isa 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 66:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,20)\">Isa 66:20</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Jer 17:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,26)\">Jer 17:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mal 1:13\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(39,1,13)\">Mal 1:13</ref> <bdbheb>הִקְרִיב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:1\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,1)\">Lev 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 2:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,8)\">Lev 2:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 2:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,11)\">Lev 2:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,7)\">Lev 6:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,25)\">Num 5:25</ref> <bdbheb>עשׂה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 6:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,17)\">Num 6:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 28:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,3